trokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1747310282, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 589000242, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "So haipipe-task stays in base: insight,\ndiscovery, paper and page all call it\n(the Task folder and P-B-E-R contract).", "originalText": "So haipipe-task stays in base: insight,\ndiscovery, paper and page all call it\n(the Task folder and P-B-E-R contract).", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "kept_s-e1d948806648", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-caf1a90aa602", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2862.5, "y": 1323.375, "width": 650.0, "height": 122.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2130437135, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1516473440, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "kept_s-eb42a09e86e0"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-eb42a09e86e0", "type": "text", "x": 2880.0, "y": 1338.375, "width": 507.37500000000006, "height": 84.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1485531110, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1521367359, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "done 261007: workbench-work moved to\n2_theme/work, beside the new haipipe-work\ndoor. The task-for-* kinds wait for Q04.", "originalText": "done 261007: workbench-work moved to\n2_theme/work, beside the new haipipe-work\ndoor. The task-for-* kinds wait for Q04.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "kept_s-caf1a90aa602", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-6ce003f9894f", "type": "text", "x": 1462.5, "y": 1573.375, "width": 1138.5, "height": 28.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 697203535, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 542163425, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "? Each numbered folder (1_data, 2_nn, 3_end, 4_individual) holds a work kind AND a pipeline:", "originalText": "? Each numbered folder (1_data, 2_nn, 3_end, 4_individual) holds a work kind AND a pipeline:", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-11c1f4b487f2", "type": "text", "x": 1462.5, "y": 1609.0, "width": 1225.125, "height": 28.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 831656810, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 471242603, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "  splitting them leaves the same number in two places (2_theme/work/1_data and 1_base/task/1_data).", "originalText": "  splitting them leaves the same number in two places (2_theme/work/1_data and 1_base/task/1_data).", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-3938ba0e7f93", "type": "text", "x": 1462.5, "y": 1644.625, "width": 1150.875, "height": 28.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1633154857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1638927968, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "? haipipe-work is a thin door (it only routes); haipipe-task keeps the Task contract in base.", "originalText": "? haipipe-work is a thin door (it only routes); haipipe-task keeps the Task contract in base.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-8526dd559bf0", "type": "text", "x": 1462.5, "y": 1680.25, "width": 1089.0, "height": 28.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1394172244, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1957676788, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "  Should the work Block/Job/Task contract (Q01) live in haipipe-work once it is written?", "originalText": "  Should the work Block/Job/Task contract (Q01) live in haipipe-work once it is written?", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-a6bdddac2b41", "type": "text", "x": 1462.5, "y": 1715.875, "width": 1163.25, "height": 28.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1314277872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1510764450, "isDeleted": false, "bo